{"status": 200, "url_final": "https://sanbox.cloud/", "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n    <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#f3efe6\" />\n    <meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\" />\n    <title>Sanbox \u2014 a self-improving computer in the cloud</title>\n    <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://sanbox.cloud/\" />\n    <meta\n      name=\"description\"\n      content=\"Sanbox is a self-improving computer in the cloud. It remembers context, turns experience into reusable skills, and keeps its tools, files, and workflows. Every task builds on the last.\"\n    />\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://sanbox.cloud/\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Sanbox \u2014 a self-improving computer in the cloud\" />\n    <meta\n      property=\"og:description\"\n      content=\"It remembers context, turns experience into reusable skills, and keeps its tools, files, and workflows. Every task builds on the last.\"\n    />\n    <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://sanbox.cloud/assets/og-image.jpg\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpeg\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"Sanbox \u2014 a self-improving computer in the cloud\" />\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n    <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Sanbox \u2014 a self-improving computer in the cloud\" />\n    <meta\n      name=\"twitter:description\"\n      content=\"It remembers context, turns experience into reusable skills, and keeps its tools, files, and workflows. Every task builds on the last.\"\n    />\n    <meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://sanbox.cloud/assets/og-image.jpg\" />\n    <meta name=\"twitter:image:alt\" content=\"Sanbox \u2014 a self-improving computer in the cloud\" />\n    <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"assets/favicon.svg?v=5\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" />\n    <link rel=\"preload\" href=\"assets/fonts/newsreader-variable.woff2\" as=\"font\" type=\"font/woff2\" crossorigin />\n    <link\n      rel=\"preload\"\n      href=\"assets/fonts/instrument-sans-variable.woff2\"\n      as=\"font\"\n      type=\"font/woff2\"\n      crossorigin\n    />\n    <link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"assets/hero-landscape.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" fetchpriority=\"high\" />\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css?v=rail-1\" />\n    <script>\n      document.documentElement.classList.add(\"js\");\n    </script>\n    <script src=\"main.js?v=rail-1\" defer></script>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <!--\n      THESIS: One ground, one continuous scroll. The page argues persistence by never\n      resetting: no alternating section fills, no card decks, no slide-per-screen. It\n      refuses the SaaS landing rhythm of full-width title, three cards, repeat.\n      OWN-WORLD: Paper #F3EFE6 under every light section, hairline #DED6C4 rules doing\n      all the dividing, brass #8F7238 hairline icons, Newsreader display over Instrument\n      Sans body. Square corners, no shadows, one dark ink block for Enterprise.\n      STORY: A technical evaluator sees a machine that keeps its state, scans nine\n      capabilities and eight channels, finds their own use case, sees the governance a\n      platform team demands, and signs up at $20.\n      FIRST VIEWPORT: Parchment bar laid over a full-bleed photograph; 68px serif H1 left\n      of centre on a left-weighted scrim; no CTA in the hero itself \u2014 the header carries\n      both actions, Sign in as a plain link and Sign up as the one filled control.\n      FORM: Client-pinned comp \u2014 design_handoff_sanbox_site/Sanbox Site v2.dc.html.\n      Brief-pinned direction; no direction roll.\n      FINISH: unreviewed and undocumented is unfinished; this build ends with the finish review, the verdict, and DESIGN.md\n    -->\n    <a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n\n    <header class=\"site-header\">\n      <div class=\"wrap header-inner\">\n        <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#top\" aria-label=\"Sanbox by Sanlabs \u2014 home\">\n          <svg\n            class=\"brand-mark\"\n            viewBox=\"-0.011462637223303318 0.06055255979299545 109.99146270751953 120.49649047851562\"\n            aria-hidden=\"true\"\n            focusable=\"false\"\n          >\n            <path\n              fill=\"currentColor\"\n              d=\"M0 85.85C0 80.92.06 76 0 71a3.65 3.65 0 0 1 2-3.5Q20.56 57 39.1 46.44q9.39-5.36 18.8-10.67a1.77 1.77 0 0 0 .94-1.77c0-10.11.08-20.22-.07-30.33 0-2.83 2.41-4.61 5.17-3C71.72 5 79.58 9.2 87.42 13.46a3.52 3.52 0 0 1 2 3.41v15.39q.09 16.64.2 33.26c.06 7.67.18 15.35.2 23a2.39 2.39 0 0 0 1.47 2.28c5.53 3.19 11 6.43 16.57 9.61a3.46 3.46 0 0 1 2.12 3.11 3.39 3.39 0 0 1-2.15 3q-12 6.66-24 13.41a3.78 3.78 0 0 1-4.17 0Q55 105.42 30.2 91a3.14 3.14 0 0 0-3.71 0c-7 4.24-14.16 8.37-21.24 12.55a3.48 3.48 0 0 1-3.44.47A3 3 0 0 1 0 101V85.85zM88.36 89l.2-.24c-.13-.27-.24-.56-.38-.82l-4.08-7.3L60 37.72a7.18 7.18 0 0 0-1.06-1.16 5.43 5.43 0 0 0-1 1Q43.74 62.7 29.61 87.84c-.17.31-.28.65-.42 1l.23.2c.54-.28 1.09-.54 1.62-.84q13.5-7.64 27-15.32a2.35 2.35 0 0 1 2.69 0q13 7.64 26 15.18c.49.31 1.06.61 1.63.94z\"\n            />\n          </svg>\n          <span class=\"brand-copy\">\n            <span class=\"brand-name\">Sanbox</span>\n            <span class=\"brand-by\">By Sanlabs</span>\n          </span>\n        </a>\n\n        <nav class=\"header-nav\" aria-label=\"Sections\">\n          <a href=\"#features\">Features</a>\n          <a href=\"#integrations\">Integrations</a>\n          <a href=\"#usecases\">Use cases</a>\n          <a href=\"#enterprise\">Enterprise</a>\n          <a href=\"#pricing\">Pricing</a>\n          <a href=\"/blog\">Blog</a>\n          <a class=\"header-signin\" href=\"https://console.sanbox.cloud/\">Sign in<svg class=\"ext\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 11 11 5\"/><path d=\"M6 5h5v5\"/></svg></a>\n          <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\" href=\"#pricing\">Request access</a>\n        </nav>\n\n        <button\n          class=\"menu-toggle\"\n          type=\"button\"\n          aria-expanded=\"false\"\n          aria-controls=\"mobile-nav\"\n          data-menu-toggle\n        >\n          <span class=\"menu-bars\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sr-only\">Menu</span>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"mobile-nav\" id=\"mobile-nav\" data-mobile-nav hidden>\n        <a href=\"#features\">Features</a>\n        <a href=\"#integrations\">Integrations</a>\n        <a href=\"#usecases\">Use cases</a>\n        <a href=\"#enterprise\">Enterprise</a>\n        <a href=\"#pricing\">Pricing</a>\n        <a href=\"/blog\">Blog</a>\n        <a class=\"signin-mobile\" href=\"https://console.sanbox.cloud/\">Sign in<svg class=\"ext\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 11 11 5\"/><path d=\"M6 5h5v5\"/></svg></a>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"#pricing\">Request access</a>\n      </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <main id=\"main\">\n      <!-- hero \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 -->\n      <section class=\"hero\" id=\"top\">\n        <div class=\"hero-scrim\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n        <div class=\"wrap hero-inner\">\n          <h1 class=\"hero-title\">A self-improving computer in the cloud.</h1>\n          <p class=\"hero-deck\">\n            It remembers context, turns experience into reusable skills, and keeps its tools, files, and\n            workflows. Every task builds on the last.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- features \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 -->\n      <section class=\"section\" id=\"features\" data-reveal>\n        <div class=\"wrap section-grid\">\n          <div class=\"rail\">\n            <h2 class=\"section-title\">Batteries included</h2>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"lattice lattice-2\">\n            <article class=\"cell\">\n              <div class=\"cell-head\">\n                <span class=\"cell-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                  <svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"8.5\" y=\"8.5\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"/><path d=\"M12 3.5a8.5 8.5 0 0 1 8.5 8.5\"/><path d=\"M12 20.5A8.5 8.5 0 0 1 3.5 12\"/><path d=\"M18.2 3.9v2.9h-2.9\"/><path d=\"M5.8 20.1v-2.9h2.9\"/></svg>\n                </span>\n                <h3 class=\"cell-title\">Self-improving agent harness</h3>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"cell-body\">\n                A built-in harness that uses tools, builds skills, and improves its workflows over time.\n              </p>\n            </article>\n\n            <article class=\"cell\">\n              <div class=\"cell-head\">\n                <span class=\"cell-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                  <svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"6\" rx=\"7.5\" ry=\"2.8\"/><path d=\"M4.5 6v6c0 1.55 3.36 2.8 7.5 2.8s7.5-1.25 7.5-2.8V6\"/><path d=\"M4.5 12v6c0 1.55 3.36 2.8 7.5 2.8s7.5-1.25 7.5-2.8v-6\"/></svg>\n                </span>\n                <h3 class=\"cell-title\">Persistent storage</h3>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"cell-body\">\n                Files, repositories, installed packages, browser sessions, and running services stay with the\n                Computer between sessions.\n              </p>\n            </article>\n\n            <article class=\"cell\">\n              <div class=\"cell-head\">\n                <span class=\"cell-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                  <svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"8.5\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4.6\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1\"/><path d=\"M12 3.5v3.9\"/><path d=\"M12 16.6v3.9\"/></svg>\n                </span>\n                <h3 class=\"cell-title\">Long-term memory</h3>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"cell-body\">\n                The Computer remembers context, past work, and learned skills so tasks can continue over\n                time\u2014not restart from scratch.\n              </p>\n            </article>\n\n            <article class=\"cell\">\n              <div class=\"cell-head\">\n                <span class=\"cell-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                  <svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"4.5\" width=\"18\" height=\"15\" rx=\"1\"/><path d=\"M3 9h18\"/><circle cx=\"6.2\" cy=\"6.8\" r=\".7\"/><circle cx=\"8.8\" cy=\"6.8\" r=\".7\"/></svg>\n                </span>\n                <h3 class=\"cell-title\">Browser use</h3>\n                <span class=\"tag tag-soon\">Coming soon</span>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"cell-body\">\n                Give agents a browser to research, navigate websites, fill forms, and complete tasks in the\n                browser.\n              </p>\n            </article>\n\n            <article class=\"cell\">\n              <div class=\"cell-head\">\n                <span class=\"cell-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                  <svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2.4\"/><circle cx=\"4.6\" cy=\"5.6\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle cx=\"19.4\" cy=\"5.6\" r=\"1.9\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"20.4\" r=\"1.9\"/><path d=\"M10.3 10.4 6.1 7\"/><path d=\"M13.7 10.4 17.9 7\"/><path d=\"M12 14.4v4.1\"/></svg>\n                </span>\n                <h3 class=\"cell-title\">Tools and MCP</h3>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"cell-body\">\n                Connect the Computer to your APIs, tools, and MCP servers. Bring your own LLM and decide what\n                it can use.\n              </p>\n            </article>\n\n            <article class=\"cell\">\n              <div class=\"cell-head\">\n                <span class=\"cell-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                  <svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3.5\" y=\"3.5\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" rx=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4.6\"/><path d=\"M12 7.4v2\"/><path d=\"M15.3 12h2\"/><path d=\"M12 16.6v-2\"/><path d=\"M8.7 12h-2\"/></svg>\n                </span>\n                <h3 class=\"cell-title\">Secrets vault</h3>\n                <span class=\"tag tag-soon\">Coming soon</span>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"cell-body\">\n                Store passwords, API keys, and tokens securely. Give the Computer access when it needs it\n                without exposing long-lived secrets directly.\n              </p>\n            </article>\n\n            <article class=\"cell\">\n              <div class=\"cell-head\">\n                <span class=\"cell-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                  <svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 3.2 4.6 6.1v6c0 4.3 3.1 7.4 7.4 8.7 4.3-1.3 7.4-4.4 7.4-8.7v-6z\"/><path d=\"M9 12.1l2.2 2.2 4-4.3\"/></svg>\n                </span>\n                <h3 class=\"cell-title\">Network policy</h3>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"cell-body\">\n                Choose which IPs, services, websites, and internal VPCs the Computer can reach. Everything\n                else stays blocked.\n              </p>\n            </article>\n\n            <article class=\"cell\">\n              <div class=\"cell-head\">\n                <span class=\"cell-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                  <svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"8.5\"/><path d=\"M12.9 7.3 9.4 12.6h3.4l-1.1 4.1 3.6-5.3h-3.4z\"/></svg>\n                </span>\n                <h3 class=\"cell-title\">Fast startup</h3>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"cell-body\">Boot a ready-to-use Computer in under one second.</p>\n            </article>\n\n            <article class=\"cell\">\n              <div class=\"cell-head\">\n                <span class=\"cell-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                  <svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"4.5\" width=\"18\" height=\"15\" rx=\"1\"/><path d=\"m7.2 9.4 2.7 2.6-2.7 2.6\"/><path d=\"M12.6 15.2h4.2\"/></svg>\n                </span>\n                <h3 class=\"cell-title\">CLI</h3>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"cell-body\">\n                Send tasks from your terminal, or from a coding agent like Claude Code or Codex.\n              </p>\n            </article>\n            <article class=\"cell\">\n              <div class=\"cell-head\">\n                <span class=\"cell-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                  <svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 6.5h16\"/><path d=\"M4 12h16\"/><path d=\"M4 17.5h16\"/><circle cx=\"8.4\" cy=\"6.5\" r=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"15.6\" cy=\"17.5\" r=\"1.5\"/></svg>\n                </span>\n                <h3 class=\"cell-title\">Web terminal</h3>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"cell-body\">\n                Run a terminal in the browser with full root access.\n              </p>\n            </article>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- integrations \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 -->\n      <section class=\"section\" id=\"integrations\" data-reveal>\n        <div class=\"wrap section-grid\">\n          <div class=\"rail\">\n            <h2 class=\"section-title\">Connect it to your work</h2>\n          </div>\n\n          <ul class=\"lattice lattice-3 channels\">\n            <li class=\"cell cell-inline\">\n              <span class=\"channel-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"5.5\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" rx=\"1\"/><path d=\"M3.6 6.4 12 13l8.4-6.6\"/></svg>\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"channel-label\">Email</span>\n            </li>\n\n            <li class=\"cell cell-inline\">\n              <span class=\"channel-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                <img src=\"assets/whatsapp-mono.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"channel-label\">WhatsApp</span>\n              <span class=\"tag tag-soon\">Coming soon</span>\n            </li>\n\n            <li class=\"cell cell-inline\">\n              <span class=\"channel-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                <img src=\"assets/telegram-mono.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"channel-label\">Telegram</span>\n            </li>\n\n            <li class=\"cell cell-inline\">\n              <span class=\"channel-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"-2.45 0 2452.5 2452.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"><g clip-rule=\"evenodd\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"><path d=\"m897.4 0c-135.3.1-244.8 109.9-244.7 245.2-.1 135.3 109.5 245.1 244.8 245.2h244.8v-245.1c.1-135.3-109.5-245.1-244.9-245.3.1 0 .1 0 0 0m0 654h-652.6c-135.3.1-244.9 109.9-244.8 245.2-.2 135.3 109.4 245.1 244.7 245.3h652.7c135.3-.1 244.9-109.9 244.8-245.2.1-135.4-109.5-245.2-244.8-245.3z\"/><path d=\"m2447.6 899.2c.1-135.3-109.5-245.1-244.8-245.2-135.3.1-244.9 109.9-244.8 245.2v245.3h244.8c135.3-.1 244.9-109.9 244.8-245.3zm-652.7 0v-654c.1-135.2-109.4-245-244.7-245.2-135.3.1-244.9 109.9-244.8 245.2v654c-.2 135.3 109.4 245.1 244.7 245.3 135.3-.1 244.9-109.9 244.8-245.3z\"/><path d=\"m1550.1 2452.5c135.3-.1 244.9-109.9 244.8-245.2.1-135.3-109.5-245.1-244.8-245.2h-244.8v245.2c-.1 135.2 109.5 245 244.8 245.2zm0-654.1h652.7c135.3-.1 244.9-109.9 244.8-245.2.2-135.3-109.4-245.1-244.7-245.3h-652.7c-135.3.1-244.9 109.9-244.8 245.2-.1 135.4 109.4 245.2 244.7 245.3z\"/><path d=\"m0 1553.2c-.1 135.3 109.5 245.1 244.8 245.2 135.3-.1 244.9-109.9 244.8-245.2v-245.2h-244.8c-135.3.1-244.9 109.9-244.8 245.2zm652.7 0v654c-.2 135.3 109.4 245.1 244.7 245.3 135.3-.1 244.9-109.9 244.8-245.2v-653.9c.2-135.3-109.4-245.1-244.7-245.3-135.4 0-244.9 109.8-244.8 245.1 0 0 0 .1 0 0\"/></g></svg>\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"channel-label\">Slack</span>\n              <span class=\"tag tag-soon\">Coming soon</span>\n            </li>\n\n\n\n            <li class=\"cell cell-inline\">\n              <span class=\"channel-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M8.4 4.2 4.2 8.4l3.1 3.1\"/><path d=\"M15.6 19.8l4.2-4.2-3.1-3.1\"/><path d=\"M14 6.4 10 17.6\"/></svg>\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"channel-label\">APIs and MCP</span>\n            </li>\n\n            <li class=\"cell cell-inline\">\n              <span class=\"channel-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 3.2 4.6 6.1v6c0 4.3 3.1 7.4 7.4 8.7 4.3-1.3 7.4-4.4 7.4-8.7v-6z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10.6\" r=\"2.2\"/><path d=\"M8.6 16.6c0-1.7 1.5-2.9 3.4-2.9s3.4 1.2 3.4 2.9\"/></svg>\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"channel-label\">Enterprise identity providers</span>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- use cases \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 -->\n      <section class=\"section\" id=\"usecases\" data-reveal>\n        <div class=\"wrap section-grid\">\n          <div class=\"rail\">\n            <h2 class=\"section-title\">Use cases</h2>\n          </div>\n\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Use cases\" data-usecase-tablist>\n              <button\n                class=\"tab\"\n                type=\"button\"\n                role=\"tab\"\n                id=\"uc-tab-1\"\n                aria-controls=\"uc-panel-1\"\n                aria-selected=\"true\"\n              >\n                <span class=\"tab-num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01</span>\n                <span class=\"tab-label\">Personal assistants</span>\n              </button>\n              <button\n                class=\"tab\"\n                type=\"button\"\n                role=\"tab\"\n                id=\"uc-tab-2\"\n                aria-controls=\"uc-panel-2\"\n                aria-selected=\"false\"\n                tabindex=\"-1\"\n              >\n                <span class=\"tab-num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">02</span>\n                <span class=\"tab-label\">Coding agents</span>\n              </button>\n              <button\n                class=\"tab\"\n                type=\"button\"\n                role=\"tab\"\n                id=\"uc-tab-3\"\n                aria-controls=\"uc-panel-3\"\n                aria-selected=\"false\"\n                tabindex=\"-1\"\n              >\n                <span class=\"tab-num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">03</span>\n                <span class=\"tab-label\">Browser automation</span>\n              </button>\n              <button\n                class=\"tab\"\n                type=\"button\"\n                role=\"tab\"\n                id=\"uc-tab-4\"\n                aria-controls=\"uc-panel-4\"\n                aria-selected=\"false\"\n                tabindex=\"-1\"\n              >\n                <span class=\"tab-num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">04</span>\n                <span class=\"tab-label\">Enterprise agent teams</span>\n              </button>\n              <button\n                class=\"tab\"\n                type=\"button\"\n                role=\"tab\"\n                id=\"uc-tab-5\"\n                aria-controls=\"uc-panel-5\"\n                aria-selected=\"false\"\n                tabindex=\"-1\"\n              >\n                <span class=\"tab-num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">05</span>\n                <span class=\"tab-label\">Internal automation</span>\n              </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"tab-panels\">\n              <div class=\"tab-panel\" id=\"uc-panel-1\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"uc-tab-1\" tabindex=\"0\">\n                <h3 class=\"panel-title\">Personal assistants</h3>\n                <p class=\"panel-body\">\n                  Automate your custom workflows with a Computer that remembers how they work.\n                </p>\n              </div>\n              <div\n                class=\"tab-panel\"\n                id=\"uc-panel-2\"\n                role=\"tabpanel\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"uc-tab-2\"\n                tabindex=\"0\"\n                hidden\n              >\n                <h3 class=\"panel-title\">Coding agents</h3>\n                <p class=\"panel-body\">\n                  Run Cursor, OpenCode, Claude Code, Codex, and other terminal-based agents.\n                </p>\n              </div>\n              <div\n                class=\"tab-panel\"\n                id=\"uc-panel-3\"\n                role=\"tabpanel\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"uc-tab-3\"\n                tabindex=\"0\"\n                hidden\n              >\n                <h3 class=\"panel-title\">Browser automation</h3>\n                <p class=\"panel-body\">\n                  Research, navigate websites, complete forms, and operate web applications.\n                </p>\n              </div>\n              <div\n                class=\"tab-panel\"\n                id=\"uc-panel-4\"\n                role=\"tabpanel\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"uc-tab-4\"\n                tabindex=\"0\"\n                hidden\n              >\n                <h3 class=\"panel-title\">Enterprise agent teams</h3>\n                <p class=\"panel-body\">\n                  Create multiple Computers with defined roles, permissions, network access, and approval\n                  rules\u2014similar to managing a fleet of devices, but for AI Computers.\n                </p>\n              </div>\n              <div\n                class=\"tab-panel\"\n                id=\"uc-panel-5\"\n                role=\"tabpanel\"\n                aria-labelledby=\"uc-tab-5\"\n                tabindex=\"0\"\n                hidden\n              >\n                <h3 class=\"panel-title\">Internal automation</h3>\n                <p class=\"panel-body\">\n                  Connect AI to company systems, databases, APIs, and VPCs without giving it unrestricted\n                  access.\n                </p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- enterprise \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 -->\n      <section class=\"section section-ink\" id=\"enterprise\" data-reveal>\n        <div class=\"wrap section-grid\">\n          <div class=\"rail\">\n            <h2 class=\"section-title\">MDM-like control</h2>\n            <p class=\"rail-deck\">Manage a fleet of Computers with the controls enterprise teams need.</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div>\n            <figure class=\"org\">\n              <figcaption class=\"org-caption\">Organization</figcaption>\n\n              <div class=\"org-canvas\">\n                <div class=\"org-root\"><span class=\"node node-root\">Northwind Group</span></div>\n                <span class=\"org-stem\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n\n                <div class=\"org-branches\">\n                  <div class=\"org-branch\">\n                    <span class=\"org-crossbar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"org-drop\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"node node-dept\">Engineering</span>\n                    <span class=\"org-drop\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                    <div class=\"org-machines\">\n                      <span class=\"node-machine\"></span>\n                      <span class=\"node-machine\"></span>\n                      <span class=\"node-machine is-pending\"></span>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n\n                  <div class=\"org-branch\">\n                    <span class=\"org-crossbar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"org-drop\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"node node-dept\">Finance</span>\n                    <span class=\"org-drop\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                    <div class=\"org-machines\">\n                      <span class=\"node-machine\"></span>\n                      <span class=\"node-machine\"></span>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n\n                  <div class=\"org-branch\">\n                    <span class=\"org-crossbar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"org-drop\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"node node-dept\">Support</span>\n                    <span class=\"org-drop\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                    <div class=\"org-machines\">\n                      <span class=\"node-machine\"></span>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <p class=\"org-legend\">\n                <span class=\"legend-item\"><span class=\"swatch\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Computer</span>\n                <span class=\"legend-item\"\n                  ><span class=\"swatch is-pending\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Awaiting approval</span\n                >\n              </p>\n            </figure>\n\n            <ul class=\"controls\">\n              <li class=\"control\">\n                <p class=\"control-head\">\n                  <span class=\"control-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                    <svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"9.4\" r=\"3.2\"/><path d=\"M3.4 19.6c0-3 2.5-5.2 5.6-5.2 1 0 2 .2 2.8.7\"/><circle cx=\"17.2\" cy=\"14.4\" r=\"2.4\"/><path d=\"M17.2 16.8v3.4l1.4 1.1 1.4-1.1v-1.2\"/></svg>\n                  </span>\n                  <span class=\"control-label\">Identity and SSO</span>\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"control-body\">Connect Okta or your existing identity provider.</p>\n              </li>\n\n              <li class=\"control\">\n                <p class=\"control-head\">\n                  <span class=\"control-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                    <svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"4.5\" y=\"10.4\" width=\"15\" height=\"9.6\" rx=\"1\"/><path d=\"M8 10.4V7.6a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v2.8\"/><path d=\"M12 14v2.6\"/></svg>\n                  </span>\n                  <span class=\"control-label\">Access policies</span>\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"control-body\">Control who can access each Computer and what it can do.</p>\n              </li>\n\n              <li class=\"control\">\n                <p class=\"control-head\">\n                  <span class=\"control-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                    <svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9.4\" y=\"2.8\" width=\"5.2\" height=\"4.2\" rx=\".6\"/><rect x=\"2.6\" y=\"16.8\" width=\"5.2\" height=\"4.2\" rx=\".6\"/><rect x=\"9.4\" y=\"16.8\" width=\"5.2\" height=\"4.2\" rx=\".6\"/><rect x=\"16.2\" y=\"16.8\" width=\"5.2\" height=\"4.2\" rx=\".6\"/><path d=\"M12 7v4.6\"/><path d=\"M5.2 16.8v-3.2h13.6v3.2\"/></svg>\n                  </span>\n                  <span class=\"control-label\">Computer hierarchy</span>\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"control-body\">Organize Computers by team, department, role, and workload.</p>\n              </li>\n\n              <li class=\"control\">\n                <p class=\"control-head\">\n                  <span class=\"control-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                    <svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"8.6\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3.4\"/><path d=\"M12 12h8.4\"/><path d=\"M17.4 12v3.2\"/><path d=\"M20.4 12v2.4\"/></svg>\n                  </span>\n                  <span class=\"control-label\">Secrets management</span>\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"control-body\">Store and issue passwords, API keys, and tokens securely.</p>\n              </li>\n\n              <li class=\"control\">\n                <p class=\"control-head\">\n                  <span class=\"control-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                    <svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"8.5\"/><path d=\"M3.5 12h17\"/><path d=\"M12 3.5c2.3 2.4 3.5 5.4 3.5 8.5s-1.2 6.1-3.5 8.5c-2.3-2.4-3.5-5.4-3.5-8.5S9.7 5.9 12 3.5z\"/></svg>\n                  </span>\n                  <span class=\"control-label\">Network controls</span>\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"control-body\">Limit access to approved services, websites, IPs, and VPCs.</p>\n              </li>\n\n              <li class=\"control\">\n                <p class=\"control-head\">\n                  <span class=\"control-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                    <svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.4 9 17.4 20 6.6\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"2.4 3.2\"/></svg>\n                  </span>\n                  <span class=\"control-label\">Human approval</span>\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"control-body\">Require sign-off for sensitive or disruptive actions.</p>\n              </li>\n\n              <li class=\"control\">\n                <p class=\"control-head\">\n                  <span class=\"control-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                    <svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 3.5h8.4L19 8.1v12.4H6z\"/><path d=\"M14.2 3.5v4.8H19\"/><path d=\"M9 12.6h6.2\"/><path d=\"M9 16.2h4.2\"/></svg>\n                  </span>\n                  <span class=\"control-label\">Audit trail</span>\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"control-body\">Track the organization, user, Computer, and action.</p>\n              </li>\n\n              <li class=\"control\">\n                <p class=\"control-head\">\n                  <span class=\"control-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                    <svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 2.8 20.6 7v10L12 21.2 3.4 17V7z\"/><path d=\"M3.4 7 12 11.3 20.6 7\"/><path d=\"M12 11.3v9.9\"/></svg>\n                  </span>\n                  <span class=\"control-label\">Custom deployment</span>\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"control-body\">Run Sanbox in our infrastructure, your cloud, or your hardware.</p>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- pricing \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 -->\n      <section class=\"section\" id=\"pricing\" data-reveal>\n        <div class=\"wrap section-grid\">\n          <div class=\"rail\">\n            <h2 class=\"section-title\">Pricing</h2>\n            <p class=\"rail-deck\">Start with a few Computers. Scale to a governed fleet.</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"plans\">\n            <div class=\"plan\">\n              <div class=\"plan-head\">\n                <h3 class=\"plan-name\">Individual</h3>\n                <p class=\"plan-price\"><span class=\"price\">$20</span> <span class=\"per\">/ month</span></p>\n              </div>\n              <ul class=\"plan-rows\">\n                <li>Up to three Computers</li>\n                <li>20 GB of pooled persistent storage</li>\n                <li>Bring your own models, tools, and MCP servers</li>\n              </ul>\n\n              <button\n                class=\"btn btn-primary plan-cta\"\n                type=\"button\"\n                aria-expanded=\"false\"\n                aria-controls=\"request\"\n                data-request-toggle\n              >\n                Request access\n              </button>\n\n              <noscript>\n                <p class=\"request-fallback\">\n                  <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"mailto:sales@sanlabs.ai?subject=Sanbox%20access%20request\">\n                    Request access by email\n                  </a>\n                </p>\n              </noscript>\n\n              <div class=\"request\" id=\"request\" hidden>\n                <div data-request-shell>\n                  <p class=\"request-note\">Tell us where to reach you. We reply within 24 hours.</p>\n                  <form\n                    class=\"request-form\"\n                    action=\"https://console.sanbox.cloud/v1/public/signup-requests\"\n                    method=\"post\"\n                    data-request-form\n                  >\n                    <label class=\"field\">\n                      <span>Email</span>\n                      <input\n                        type=\"email\"\n                        name=\"email\"\n                        autocomplete=\"email\"\n                        placeholder=\"you@company.com\"\n                        required\n                      />\n                    </label>\n                    <label class=\"field\">\n                      <span>Organization</span>\n                      <input\n                        type=\"text\"\n                        name=\"organization\"\n                        autocomplete=\"organization\"\n                        placeholder=\"Company or personal\"\n                        maxlength=\"160\"\n                        required\n                      />\n                    </label>\n                    <label class=\"field\">\n                      <span>Use case</span>\n                      <textarea\n                        name=\"use_case\"\n                        rows=\"3\"\n                        maxlength=\"1000\"\n                        required\n                      ></textarea>\n                    </label>\n                    <label class=\"trap\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                      Website\n                      <input type=\"text\" name=\"website\" autocomplete=\"off\" tabindex=\"-1\" />\n                    </label>\n                    <button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-block\" type=\"submit\" data-request-submit>\n                      <span data-request-submit-label>Send request</span>\n                    </button>\n                    <p class=\"privacy\">\n                      We use these details to answer your request. See our\n                      <a href=\"datenschutz/#signup-requests\">privacy notice</a>.\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"form-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" data-request-status></p>\n                  </form>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"request-done\" data-request-success hidden>\n                  <p class=\"request-done-title\" tabindex=\"-1\">We\u2019ll be in touch.</p>\n                  <p class=\"request-note\">\n                    We have the request for <strong data-request-email></strong>. You\u2019ll hear from us within\n                    24 hours.\n                  </p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"plan\">\n              <div class=\"plan-head\">\n                <h3 class=\"plan-name\">Enterprise</h3>\n                <p class=\"plan-price\"><span class=\"per\">Starting from $300/month</span></p>\n              </div>\n              <ul class=\"plan-rows\">\n                <li class=\"plan-row-lead\">Professional services to build custom integrations</li>\n                <li>SSO and custom identity integrations</li>\n                <li>Deploy in your VPCs</li>\n              </ul>\n              <a class=\"btn btn-secondary plan-cta\" href=\"mailto:sales@sanlabs.ai?subject=Sanbox%20Enterprise\">\n                Talk to us\n              </a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </main>\n\n    <footer class=\"site-footer\">\n      <div class=\"wrap footer-inner\">\n        <nav class=\"footer-links\" aria-label=\"Legal\">\n          <a href=\"impressum/\">Impressum</a>\n          <a href=\"datenschutz/\">Datenschutz</a>\n        </nav>\n        <p class=\"footer-line\">\u00a9 2026 Sanlabs GmbH</p>\n      </div>\n    </footer>\n  </body>\n</html>\n", "erro": "", "ms": 532}